  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">코로나 상황에서 과학 행사는 해야겠고. 고민하다가 카페에서 여기저기서 본거 짜집기 해서 1학기에 치룬 행사입니다ㅎㅎ<br>도움을 많이 받은지라 학생들 자료 올려봅니다. 2학기에도 다들 화이팅하세요!<br>1.빛사진전:수업 시간에 미리 빛의 성질에 대해 알려주고 빛의 성질을 담은 사진 작품을 위두랑에 제출하여 학교 사진인화기로 인화하여 전시하고 투표도 했어요! 아이들이 참 좋아했답니다.</p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4109a88974e17324c957f9661822993a80ad529d\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/691d2e0443d540c283d59c853e0a2ad522dd38cd\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f8f654cf254a7c31d144c5cf435e9359cca64a6\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">2.과학시화전:학년별로 단원을 주고 과학시를 쓰게 했습니다.</p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a5a19b04c1fe2cddaceba691967d056064a8376\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ee1380a695390dfd668eab8c0d8325724f95fad\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/146f26f697ae056a6533a864458bb5c3bb9d86da\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fdb6d0b366115fecefc23d39c50aaa59b39acebb\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf1bd92fc6ae6ff39f29b7a4358f69b16f8efa7f\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00bc7588d757cd448a1dc615ed577fb9e76adc55\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccba4e10876aee8600ab08bac5967728caa7e00d\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">3.과학이모티콘: 수업시간에 카카오톡 이과티콘을 함께 보며 구상하는 연습을 해보고 주제를 주고 진행했습니다.</p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07844a03cbd670eed427f817ee941e3f445dfe3c\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b834ad85fc11d01722958df61f28f433f56e75cf\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7df2b9638efd6b7de5728973222d3729493ad7e\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f828d4d7436260cf8310398679a4e124659a77ae\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/629036740988e3afe097811fd828689f9e449ae3\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c45f754a9d8bdc250ceee7533faf6ee12d159b5\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>자료 몇개 추가합니다. 당시 썼던 서식이나 계획서들이예요. 저는 작은 학교에 근무하고 있어서 과학 교사가 저 혼자 뿐이라&nbsp;좀 편하게&nbsp;진행한 부분이 있어요. 부족하지만 도움이 되시면 좋겠어요! 각종 서식들은 네이버 무료 폰트를 받으시면 예쁘게 쓰실 수 있어요! </p><p>그리고 요청하신 빛사진전 작품들은 제가 전시한다고 아이들 설명이랑 작품명 적은 것들을 잘라버렸네요ㅠㅠ몇개만 첨부해봅니다.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99880F425F48A3F60E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20200828_120517.jpg\"  id=\"A_99880F425F48A3F60ED5BB\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D27%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile246.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99ADB2485F48A46321B58F')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 1_창의컨텐츠공모전홍보포스터양식.pptx</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D28%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile276.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99F8E2485F48A4631F7A50')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 2_이모티콘만들기서식.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D29%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile293.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99EF0F485F48A4641E47F2')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 3_2020 과학창의콘텐츠공모전 실시 계획.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D30%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile287.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99A7D4485F48A46415F8F7')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 4_2020과학창의컨텐츠공모전설명_학생홍보용.pptx</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D31%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile269.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F993A78485F48A46418D009')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 5_빛사진전 작품 설명서_가로.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D32%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile293.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F994691485F48A4651E2868')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 6_빛사진전 작품 설명서_세로.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D33%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile261.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99FEA2485F48A4651F80BA')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 7_시화전 서식.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D34%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile273.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99DEAA485F48A46513B2D5')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 8_창의콘텐츠공모전로고.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D206%26fileid%3D35%26regdt%3D20200828004932&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile267.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F992BBC485F48A46511CFC2')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 9_빛사진전 예선탈락작품설명문구.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
